.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mnnn-schedule-add 1  "mnnn-schedule-add 2.25.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-schedule\-add \- Add a schedule running a rule set or an ingest connector
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn schedule add\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-ruleset\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-plugin\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-pipeline\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-connector\-ruleset\fR] [\fB\-\-log\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-option\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-start\-at\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-ends\-at\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-for\fR] [\fB\-\-transport\fR] [\fB\-\-cron\fR] [\fB\-\-tz\fR] [\fB\-\-past\fR] [\fB\-\-overlap\fR] [\fB\-\-catch\-up\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-attempts\fR] [\fB\-\-disabled\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> [\fIRUN_EVERY\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a schedule running a rule set or an ingest connector
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-ruleset\fR \fI<RULESET>\fR
The rule set to run (ruleset schedules)
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-plugin\fR \fI<PLUGIN>\fR
Ingest connector (code space) to run
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR
Source where the connector stores raw items
.TP
\fB\-\-pipeline\fR \fI<PIPELINE>\fR
Pipeline the connector\*(Aqs `host.pipe` runs
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-connector\-ruleset\fR \fI<CONNECTOR_RULESET>\fR
Rule set the connector\*(Aqs `host.run_ruleset` runs (optional)
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-file\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Write logs to this file instead of stderr (the TUI defaults to <home>/logs/tui.log)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_LOG_FILE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-option\fR \fI<KEY=VALUE>\fR
Schedule options for the connector (`key=value`, repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-start\-at\fR \fI<DATE>\fR
Start: GNU date style ("tomorrow 9am", "2026\-12\-01 08:00")
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-ends\-at\fR \fI<DATE>\fR
End: no run starts at or after it
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-for\fR \fI<INTERVAL>\fR
End this long after the start (2 weeks, 30d)
.TP
\fB\-\-transport\fR \fI<stream|poll>\fR
How live collaboration reaches peers: `stream` (gRPC streams, the default) or `poll` (requests over the peer connection; for containers). Overrides MUNINN_COLLAB_TRANSPORT and the `net config \-\-collab\-transport` setting
.TP
\fB\-\-cron\fR \fI<CRON>\fR
Cron times instead of run_every: "0 9 * * 1\-5"
.TP
\fB\-\-tz\fR \fI<TZ>\fR
Zone for dates, months and cron (default UTC; `local` for this node\*(Aqs)
.TP
\fB\-\-past\fR \fI<WHAT>\fR
A past \-\-start\-at: `next\-interval` moves it to the next slot (without asking)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
next\-interval
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-overlap\fR \fI<OVERLAP>\fR
A run still going when the next is due: skip it or queue one
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
skip
.IP \(bu 2
queue
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-catch\-up\fR \fI<CATCH_UP>\fR
Missed runs (the scheduler was off): once, all (up to 100) or none
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
once
.IP \(bu 2
all
.IP \(bu 2
none
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-attempts\fR \fI<MAX_ATTEMPTS>\fR
Tries per run (failures retry after 30 s, 1 min, 2 min, …)
.TP
\fB\-\-disabled\fR
Add it switched off
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

.TP
[\fIRUN_EVERY\fR]
The interval (1h, "2 days", "1 month", once); not with \-\-cron
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.25.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
